1. Definitions

“Zygote Builder” means the project and repository created and maintained by Pradhyumna Nittala, including its GitHub repository and its publicly accessible website at https://zygotebuilder.github.io/.

“Program” means an individual simulation, game, experiment, webpage, application or other software project contained in Zygote Builder. All Programs are part of the Zygote Builder user experience.

“Zygote Builder Code” means original source code created by Pradhyumna Nittala and contained in a Program, including HTML, CSS, JavaScript and other source code.

“Assets” means original artwork, illustrations, images, animations, audio, video, fonts, icons, interface designs and other creative material contained in Zygote Builder.

“Commercial Use” means use primarily intended for or directed toward commercial advantage or monetary compensation, including selling, licensing, renting, monetizing, or incorporating the material into a product or service offered for payment.

